     "id": "s1",
     "prompt": "Talk about a meal that you enjoy.\nYou should say:\n• who prepares it for you\n• when you eat it\nand explain why you like it.",
     "sampleAnswer": "The meal I enjoy most is my grandmother's fish soup with rice. She usually prepares it for the whole family when we visit her house on Sunday. First, she fries some tomatoes and onions, then she adds fresh fish, pineapple and some herbs, and boils everything for about twenty minutes. The kitchen smells delicious! We usually eat it at lunchtime, all together around a big table, so it's a very happy time. I like this meal for two reasons. Firstly, it's healthy and not too heavy, so I never feel tired after eating it. Secondly, it reminds me of my childhood, because my grandmother has cooked it for me since I was very small. I've tried fish soup in restaurants, but it's never as good as hers.",
     "sampleNote": "Đủ 3 ý theo thứ tự (who → when → why), có mô tả cách nấu bằng động từ của unit, phần \"why\" có 2 lý do (Firstly, Secondly).",
